SUMMARY:Restring Appalchia Grand Opening
DESCRIPTION:✨GRAND OPENING ANNOUNCEMENT✨ \nA year in the making\, our VERY FIRST brick and mortar location opens OCTOBER 31st on Halloween in Marshall\, NC 🎃 \nThis space will support musicians in the area from the ground up\, and bring incredible and diverse programming. Our grand reveal will be 1-5pm\, featuring: \n•Ribbon cutting ceremony\n•Meet the team\n•Live old time music\n•Costume contest (with prizes!)\n•Free membership signups for musicians\n•Puppet Show with @dsherenow\n•Crankie Story with @primrosecoke \nThis opportunity would not be possible without our partners in the Marshall Music Exchange. We love you JoLeigh and Lee Bowden ❤️ \nSee you at 38 S. Main Street
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/restring-appalchia-grand-opening/
LOCATION:Restring Appalchia Marshall\, 38 N Main St\, Marshall\, NC\, 28753
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
GEO:35.7975369;-82.6846339
